{
  "epId": 10934,
  "name": "秘闻馆",
  "desc": "<p>情报界的黑市，各方势力买卖消息的最佳渠道。据说，在这家机构的背后，运作着覆盖整个「北大陆情报网」。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/02/326985891/84b03faf7ae46fe21572882f2cfafe33_4647489526150400665.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1786114777,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》挪德卡莱生态短片 - 月亮的馈赠"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/06/18/237301566/1273417acc031ba8b45700f13df9962f_4334885385042264981.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>2025年8月29日</color>\n在挪德卡莱，「月亮」的力量可不容忽视。\n抵达之前，不妨听听关于月亮的情报吧。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=tfEl4k5niyg"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "员工"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8894,
        "name": "奈芙尔",
        "desc": "神通广大的「秘闻馆」之主。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/10/21/7557acebcb72b4d9912bcb0e6c92306a_3655566527985254987.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「秘闻馆」之主与创立者，曾亲手铲除在挪德卡莱境内的所有犯罪首领。她统领着「北大陆情报网」，也是「伏尼契商会」的幕后主导者。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9018,
        "name": "雅珂达",
        "desc": "十分可靠，无所不能（自称）的「秘闻馆」员工。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/12/01/19708bac6eba4779a70908bf0bee70b1_1653339605275422455.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「秘闻馆」的优秀员工，在「海钩帮」覆灭之后加入了奈芙尔。\n阿舍鲁\n「秘闻馆」的秘书，也是奈芙尔的猫。它是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9037,
        "name": "图特",
        "desc": "<p>鹮之王是赤王的七柱之一，是众书记之书记。图特代表了赤王最为智慧的一面，奉王之命发明了沙漠文字与魔法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/06/22/326985891/348c5d2cc1cf42730c6eb76c79aa8b4f_1433791600021894332.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的使者，曾经通过它与奈芙尔交流。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「伏尼契商会」\n「秘闻馆」与最具有影响力的商会关系密切。\n联合会\n挪德卡莱为提供保护、解决各类问题而设立的行政机构。奈芙尔作为「秘闻馆」的代表也加入其中。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "旅行者经常协助「秘闻馆」并完成各种委托。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
